{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>For suddenly</b> — their calamity will arise upon you, if you do not fear them." "<b>And calamity</b> — they are one calamity, and their meaning is trouble and distress." "<b>Both of them</b> — HaShem and the king." "<b>Who knows</b> — the time when their calamity and ruin come."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:24:30.975181523Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}